      "created_at": "2014-05-14T17:02:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So I wondered if anyone would be interested in trying a forum game Vengeance Style vs. Converted villains.</p><p>Over at BGG we've constructed promo character cards for all of the normal villains that turn them into Vengeance style villains.</p><p>I've tested all of them and they are fun, but pretty hard, and some of them interact in horrible ways, at least for heroes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So if anyone is interested let me know and we'll throw down, otherwise we can roll a normal match.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For anyone concerned these are simply promo character cards, the only change to the decks are the 5 cards removed to fix deck size and balance the game.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:21.440Z",
